<title>FINLAND: Nokia rises on top-of-range Q1 report.</title>
<headline>Nokia rises on top-of-range Q1 report.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Finnish telecoms group Nokia Oy rose on Tuesday after Nokia reported first-quarter profit up to 1.45 billion markka -- near the top range of forecasts -- from 399 million a year ago.</p>
<p>At 1215/0915 GMT, Nokia traded at 312.00 markka, up 11.00 on Monday's close, and up 7.00 on levels just before the results were released. Volume was a lively 100 million markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
